# Test262 keyed promise combinator subset — known-failure allowlist
#
# Covers test/built-ins/Promise/allKeyed/ and
# test/built-ins/Promise/allSettledKeyed/ from the pinned tc39/test262
# corpus.
#
# Format: one `<file> (<scenario>)` per line. Blank lines and `# …`
# comments are ignored.
#
# A test listed here is expected to fail; if it starts passing, the
# runner reports it as `unrecognized` and fails the run (drift signal
# — fix the entry, then remove from the list).
#
# A test NOT listed here that fails the run will be reported as a
# regression and fail the build.
#
# Scenarios:
#   strict  — test composed with 'use strict' prologue
#   sloppy  — test composed without strict prologue
#   raw     — test has flags:[raw], harness omitted
#
# Match shape mirrors packages/temporal-infra/test262-config/test262.allowlist
# — keep it portable across runners.

# Empty: the native implementation has not been measured against the corpus
# yet, because that needs a built node-smol binary. Add entries only for
# failures an actual run produced, one per line, each with the reason above
# it — never pre-emptively.
